terest. |\n | ![Animation II](figures/subset_intervals_wproba_16.gif) |  - Forecasts **outside** trained intervals are noisy.<br>- **Interval classification** helps identify reliable forecasts.<br>- Supports better forecast selection during inference-time. |\n |![Animation III](figures/patching_inf_16.gif) | -  Interval-Based Forecast Patching uses **probabilistic interval classification**.<br>- Leverages models trained on intervals overlapping region of interest.<br>- Demonstrates adaptive capability of the framework for inference-time focus on task-specific regions. |\n "}]}